@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Release client transcript
+
+Interactive usage lists inspect, --format, --report and all three format choices in cli --help. The desktop client invokes:
+
+    agy-rs cli inspect --format tap --report "unit report.tap"
+    agy-rs cli inspect --json '{"format":"tap","path":"unit report.tap"}'
+
+For any format and path these spellings have the same stdout and exit status, including on errors. Generic --cwd and --max-chars remain available. The inventory client expects the historical public operations in order followed by inspect_report. For inspect_report its required string properties are path and format (the enum diff, lcov, tap). The optional properties are cwd (string) and maxChars (integer). Update both existing registry tests with this release.
